-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">「</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">구미시 문화도시 만들기 사업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">구미시 문화특화지역조성사업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">」</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">을 추진하고 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">다양한 계층의 시민들이 가진 의견을 사업에 반영하고 사업에 대한 시민들의 관심 및 적극적인 참여를 유도하기 위해 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">「</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-W